// ========================================
// HOW THE AI INTERVIEW SYSTEM WORKS
// ========================================

/*
1. INTERVIEW SETUP:
   - Restaurant creates interview templates for different positions
   - AI Agent is configured with interview capabilities
   - Candidate applies to job → Interview is automatically scheduled

2. INTERVIEW CONDUCT:
   - AI Agent calls candidate at scheduled time
   - Asks pre-defined questions from template
   - Records entire conversation (voice/video)
   - Analyzes responses in real-time
   - Asks follow-up questions based on answers

3. INTERVIEW ANALYSIS:
   - Automatic transcription of entire interview
   - Sentiment analysis of each response
   - Keyword matching for expected answers
   - Scoring across multiple criteria
   - Cultural fit assessment

4. INTERVIEW RESULTS:
   - Comprehensive interview summary
   - Candidate scoring (1-10) across different areas
   - Hire/No-hire recommendation with reasoning
   - Comparison with other candidates
   - Detailed strengths and weaknesses

5. INTEGRATION WITH EXISTING SYSTEM:
   - Uses existing JobOffer, Employee, Restaurant models
   - Integrates with current application process
   - Leverages existing user roles and permissions
   - Works with current plan system (PREMIUM feature)

TECHNICAL IMPLEMENTATION:
- Voice: WebRTC for real-time audio
- Transcription: OpenAI Whisper API
- Analysis: OpenAI GPT-4 for response analysis
- Recording: Cloud storage (AWS S3, Google Cloud)
- Real-time: WebSocket for live interview updates
*/
